Enhances: xfce4-panel
Description: multi-column application menu for the Xfce panel
 Vibris Menu is an alternate application launcher for the Xfce panel. It
 shows favorites, recently used applications and every category as a grid
 of several columns, so a large menu fits on screen without scrolling.
 The menu can be resized from any edge, and its width follows the widest
 item.
 .
 Vibris Menu is a fork of Whisker Menu and can be installed alongside it.
